<p>You create an orb attuned to thaumaturgy for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>While it lasts, any beam spell you cast will be duplicated and also cast for free at the orb for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">41%, 53%, 61%, 67%, 71%</acronym> of the normal damage.</p><p></p>